---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Education & Learning" description="Schools, e-learning and study resources." sectionEmoji="🛠️" sectionLabel="Citizen & Visitor Services" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true}>
  <p>Use this page for school, study and e-learning related questions, including where to find resources and who to contact.</p>

  <h2>Checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identify the exact level or institution you need</li>
    <li>Collect any transcripts or learner information</li>
    <li>Check whether the request is online or in person</li>
    <li>Save contact details for follow-up</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What it covers</h2>
  <p>School information, learning portals, study resources and government-supported education services.</p>
<h2>Useful resources</h2>
  <p>Nauru may use online portals and government-linked services for learning support, so verify the current route before submitting anything.</p>
<h2>How to move forward</h2>
  <p>If you need help for a student or learner, gather the relevant details first and then contact the office that handles the program.</p>

  <h2>Next steps</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/directory/">Directory →</a>
    <a href="/contact/">Contact →</a>
    <a href="/services/">Services hub →</a>
    <a href="/news/">Latest updates →</a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:16px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;font-weight:700;display:block}
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
